</table></div>
<p>Scripts and raw results: exec/glimmer-20261016/ (campaign.sh, chain.sh, gen_compare.py, this generator) and exec/results/glimmer-20261016/ (rt-results.txt, rt/&lt;run&gt;.log with the exit reports, results.json).</p>
